                      <div class="destinations-title-wrap">
                        <h2 class="section-title">every major trade lane.</h2><img src="/images/Rectangle-8-1_1Rectangle-8-1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Assorted suitcase shapes and sizes arranged together in shades of blue, gray, and orange with rounded top corners." class="small-image">
